    "title": "Grand Avenue Shooting Adds to East Price Hill Gunfire Reports - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hazel Ramirez ,\n14 hours ago A man was found with non-life-threatening injuries early Thursday after a shooting erupted on Grand Avenue in East Price Hill, around 12:30 a.m., according to police. A responding officer discovered the male victim at the scene, making him the latest casualty in a string of gunfire incidents that have rattled the West Side Cincinnati neighborhood in recent weeks. Read full article",
